  "content_id": "16136231",
  "title": "Pirate Chain ARRR Network Fees",
  "description": "Pirate Chain (ARRR) Network – Privacy First\nPirate Chain is a privacy-focused blockchain where all transactions are shielded for full anon...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ2Y3HMSBRYHN8XPF1397VC\">Pirate Chain (ARRR) Network – Privacy First</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Pirate Chain is a privacy-focused blockchain where all transactions are shielded for full anonymity.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2Y3HMEMAPGAE73AA94HRB\">How ARRR Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">ARRR uses:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size in bytes</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>ARRR tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates the right fee dynamically based on transaction size and current network activity.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2Y3HM00GR614DWBBEJNYJ\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Faster confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Best for everyday use</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest option</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Set your own if needed</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2Y3HM08S2PQWBVAPQ9KWN\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">ARRR transactions typically cost <b>$0.01 to $0.10 USD</b> depending on complexity.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2Y3HM87AVTG0X49S9GSJN\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Privacy can require a bit more data and slightly higher fees, but ARRR keeps it affordable. Edge lets you adjust fees easily without compromising privacy.</p>",
